+# TLS certificate verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included; it is not disabled for local development. Local testing uses self-signed certificates rather than turning verification off. This is reinforced by the decision to use https everywhere with no plaintext exception, since certificate management is now in place.
